WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.060
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.690
AI for Teens, video 4.

3
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.080
Train / test splits.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.259
If you test on the same examples you trained on, your score

5
00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:14.910
is flattering and false.

6
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.012
Hold out a test set you will not train on.

7
00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:21.645
Train on the rest.

8
00:00:21.695 --> 00:00:24.912
Score only on the held-out test set.

9
00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:29.450
The test set is the exam paper you must not study.

10
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.956
Collect and clean labelled data.

11
00:00:34.006 --> 00:00:35.992
Hold out a test set.

12
00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:38.332
Train on the remainder.

13
00:00:38.382 --> 00:00:41.080
Score only on the test set.

14
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.822
Let us recap.

15
00:00:43.872 --> 00:00:48.323
Never grade yourself on the training homework.

16
00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:52.335
Held-out tests estimate real performance.

17
00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.270
Next: Metrics beyond accuracy.
